            "logo": "",
            "pretitle": "Features",
            "title_tag": "h1",
            "title": "Advanced Technology, Simplified",
            "subtitle_tag": "h1",
            "subtitle": "",
            "text": "<p>Simple keypad to operate the mower using the auto mow or spot cut modes and to activate and deactivate the ultrasonic sensors. No app required.</p>",
